## Decisão arquitetural V33
- Web: React Three Fiber (manter)
- Desktop: wgpu Rust nativo (zero refletir R3F no Rust)

## Law XVI — Creative Fusion + Travas (binding)
- **Custody chain:** Intent → CostGuard → Squad → Fusion → Provider → Yjs Tx → Manifest → Viewport → Ledger
- **Trava I:** CreativeBridge (J.1) + CreativeCostGuard — BYOK/credits reserve/settle; zero platform pay free tier
- **Trava II:** CreativeFusionTransaction — all manifest/viewport/graph writes; Ctrl+Z atomic revert
- **Trava III:** VideoToMechanic (J.6) = State Machine + BT scaffold only; user wires physics — no "video → GTA"
- **Contracts:** `CreativeArtifactRequest`, `CreativeFusionTransaction`, `creative-cost-guard.ts`

## Law XV — Scalable Fidelity (binding)
- Capability Score 0–100; ScalableRenderGraph; FSR; baked-lighting publish mandatory
- WebGL2 Safari official; bindless carve-out vs Lei V wgpu

## Law XI — Fusion (binding)
- Actor→Critic REJECT loop max 3; **dual-stack validation** before patch surface
- **Web:** `npm run typecheck` + `npm run lint` (touched files)
- **Rust (mandatory if `.rs` touched):** `cargo check` + `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` + `cargo test` in `apps/studio-local/src-tauri`
- Critic **forbidden** from approving Desktop/backend patches without green Rust gates
- Wire production tool bus + evidence ledger to Agents UI (A.5, J.2)

## Patch guards (binding)
- **H.0 blocker:** `payouts.ts` revenue lanes
- **RTv1:** Hub checkout held until H auditado (fail-closed, not mock UI)
- **AI-v1:** J.1 before marketing AI-native claims
- Discovery 2k: 30 dias + Compression Mandate + IA moderation
- Reviews fail-closed até F.2; Social moderação antes party/deep link
- Cross-play marketing bloqueado até G.2

## Stack canônico
- Next 14 | React 18 | TS strict | Tailwind 4 + `var(--aethel-*)`
- Monaco | xterm | Three/R3F/Drei | Yjs | Zustand | Prisma
- Logger: `createComponentLogger` (NUNCA console.log)

## Limites
- Componente: ≤ 500 LoC
- Sem PT-BR em UI (react-i18next / EN)
- Sem hex em TSX (tokens only)

## Quality gates pré-PR (Law XI — dual stack)

### Web / TypeScript
```bash
cd cloud-web-app/web
npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run test
npm run qa:design-system-consistency
npm run qa:hardcoded-colors
npm run qa:button-types
```

### Desktop / Rust — **OBRIGATÓRIO se tocar `.rs`**
```bash
cd apps/studio-local/src-tauri
cargo check
cargo clippy -- -D warnings
cargo test
```

**Critic QA:** proibido aprovar alteração em backend Desktop sem `cargo check` + `cargo clippy` verdes. PR misto = ambos os portões.

