- Render: `lib/aaa-render-system.ts` (566 LoC) + `lib/aaa-renderer-impl.ts`
- **Law XVI:** `lib/production/creative-artifact-bridge.ts`, `creative-cost-guard.ts`, `creative-fusion-transaction.ts`, `video-to-scaffold-extractor.ts`
- **Law XI:** `lib/production/agent-tool-bus.ts`, `agent-tool-job-runner.ts`, `task-evidence-ledger.ts`
- Fusion: `lib/ai/intelligent-model-router.ts`, `fusion-role-map.ts`, `agent-llm-bridge.ts`
- Creative split (fix J.1): `lib/ai-tools-registry.creative.ts` vs `app/api/ai/*/generate`
- Hardware Law XV: `packages/engine/render/hardware-profile.ts`, `scalable-render-graph/`
- GAS: Rust `gameplay_ability_system.rs` — IPC binário 60Hz
- Publish: `lib/production/publish-pipeline-orchestrator.ts` (+ baked-lighting)

## Forbiddens
- Criar `MonacoEditorPro.runtime.tsx`, `agent-run-ledger.ts`, `scene-graph-node.ts`
- Bypass CreativeBridge or CostGuard (Trava I)
- Manifest/viewport write without Yjs transaction (Trava II)
- VideoToMechanic auto-physics or "video → GTA" marketing (Trava III)
- Publish export without baked-lighting; Capability Score ignored
- Checkout/earnings UI antes de H.0; AI-native marketing antes de J.1+J.2+J.12
- Cross-play marketing antes de G.2; Reviews antes de F.2
- Tocar código morto (`src/`, `client/`, etc.)

## Platform Reality
- Web = autoria + demos + webgl2 blueprint + CreativeBridge
- Desktop = AAA ScalableRenderGraph + Nexus squads + sidecar AI
